1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:01,500
<i> I thought you weren't coming.</i>

2
00:00:01,633 --> 00:00:02,933
<i>Why did you have Andrew
beaten up?</i>

3
00:00:03,067 --> 00:00:04,000
<i> So, what's next?</i>

4
00:00:04,133 --> 00:00:05,600
<i>Are you going to take down
me and Peter</i>

5
00:00:05,733 --> 00:00:06,967
<i>because we already know
the truth?</i>

6
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,067
<i>That you're part
of the syndicate?</i>

7
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,133
<i> I came here</i>

8
00:00:09,267 --> 00:00:10,633
<i>because I was worried
about Andrew.</i>

9
00:00:10,767 --> 00:00:12,333
<i>But you're accusing me
of so many things.</i>

10
00:00:12,467 --> 00:00:14,667
<i>We placed a tracker
on Jin Ho's car.</i>

11
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,133
<i> The last movement recorded</i>

12
00:00:16,267 --> 00:00:18,267
<i>was at Bolivar Mushroom Chips
Manufacturing.</i>

13
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,167
<i>We'll expedite a search warrant.</i>

14
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,267
<i>And good thing,
I already spoke with the DDE.</i>

15
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:24,000
<i>Peter, why are you
calling Jin Ho?</i>

16
00:00:24,133 --> 00:00:26,200
<i>I just want Jin Ho
to save himself.</i>

17
00:00:26,333 --> 00:00:28,633
<i>This is our chance to bring down
the syndicate.</i>

18
00:00:28,767 --> 00:00:30,867
<i>Can you promise
that when you arrest Jin Ho,</i>

19
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,133
<i>- you won't hurt him?
- I'll try.</i>

20
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,367
<i> [OBB]</i>

21
00:00:53,067 --> 00:00:57,167
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

22
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,867
[PHONE RINGS]

23
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,367
[OPERATOR SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY
ON PHONE]

24
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:05,200
<i>Check the number
and dial again.</i>

25
00:01:05,333 --> 00:01:06,500
[PHONE CHIMES]

26
00:01:09,533 --> 00:01:13,667
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

27
00:01:16,067 --> 00:01:17,767
[GATE CREAKS]

28
00:01:22,833 --> 00:01:26,833
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES

29
00:01:36,067 --> 00:01:39,767
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

30
00:01:44,733 --> 00:01:47,800
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

31
00:01:57,267 --> 00:02:01,267
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

32
00:02:07,133 --> 00:02:11,200
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

33
00:02:11,333 --> 00:02:12,400
Oh, Mom...

34
00:02:12,533 --> 00:02:13,567
Yes?

35
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:15,567
- Joey?
- Did you see Peter?

36
00:02:16,733 --> 00:02:18,167
No, I didn't notice him.

37
00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:19,400
He could be outside.

38
00:02:19,533 --> 00:02:21,200
He's not there either,

39
00:02:21,333 --> 00:02:24,333
and his cell phone is gone.

40
00:02:25,367 --> 00:02:27,500
Did he go home?

41
00:02:27,633 --> 00:02:30,533
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

42
00:02:30,667 --> 00:02:32,533
Stay here, okay?
I'll just go upstairs.

43
00:02:32,667 --> 00:02:34,033
Okay, Mom.

44
00:02:35,533 --> 00:02:39,967
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

45
00:02:42,433 --> 00:02:46,533
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

46
00:02:55,633 --> 00:02:57,167
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

47
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:58,967
Why is no one here?

48
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,500
Could Jin Ho be here?

49
00:03:06,067 --> 00:03:08,200
[PHONE RINGING]

50
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,967
Hello, Joey?

51
00:03:12,100 --> 00:03:13,800
Peter, why did you
suddenly disappear?

52
00:03:13,933 --> 00:03:15,333
Did you go home?

53
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,367
Joey, don't be mad, okay?

54
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:21,900
But I'm at the warehouse
to warn Jin Ho.

55
00:03:22,067 --> 00:03:23,233
What?

56
00:03:23,367 --> 00:03:26,767
[FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING]

57
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:28,067
Peter?

58
00:03:29,900 --> 00:03:31,700
What are you doing here?

59
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:37,000
[BRAZEN MUSIC PLAYING]

60
00:03:37,900 --> 00:03:39,833
[OPERATOR SPEAKING ON PHONE]

61
00:03:39,967 --> 00:03:42,300
<i> Please try again later.</i>

62
00:03:43,533 --> 00:03:45,467
Peter, come on!

63
00:03:47,933 --> 00:03:51,567
Mom, I'm going out
to meet Peter.

64
00:03:51,700 --> 00:03:53,167
It's important.

65
00:03:57,067 --> 00:03:58,167
Joey...

66
00:03:59,833 --> 00:04:01,700
I know I hurt you.

67
00:04:01,833 --> 00:04:02,900
I'm sorry.

68
00:04:03,033 --> 00:04:04,400
[BRAZEN MUSIC PLAYING]

69
00:04:04,533 --> 00:04:05,967
No, that's wrong.

70
00:04:08,267 --> 00:04:09,867
Joey...

71
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,567
I know you're angry with me.

72
00:04:12,567 --> 00:04:13,867
I'm sorry.

73
00:04:18,233 --> 00:04:20,000
Joey...
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

74
00:04:23,767 --> 00:04:25,867
Where is she going?

75
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:30,267
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

76
00:04:37,233 --> 00:04:38,167
Answer me.

77
00:04:38,300 --> 00:04:39,233
Why did you come here?

78
00:04:39,367 --> 00:04:40,400
To warn you.

79
00:04:40,533 --> 00:04:41,833
You need to leave.

80
00:04:41,967 --> 00:04:43,300
- Why?
- What do you mean why?

81
00:04:43,433 --> 00:04:45,267
The DDE and the police
are coming here.

82
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,267
They're going to raid
this place.

83
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,733
They're going to come after you.

84
00:04:47,867 --> 00:04:49,200
What?

85
00:04:49,333 --> 00:04:51,067
How did they know this place?

86
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:54,700
They put a tracker on your car
when we met.

87
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:56,833
We need to leave

88
00:04:56,967 --> 00:04:59,133
before they catch us, come on!

89
00:04:59,267 --> 00:05:03,367
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

90
00:05:15,333 --> 00:05:16,733
[KNOCKING]

91
00:05:16,867 --> 00:05:18,567
Who's there?
[KNOCKING]

92
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:24,367
We have a search warrant!

93
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:26,433
Where's your boss?
Who's inside?

94
00:05:26,567 --> 00:05:29,233
Ma'am, Sir, the two of us
are just guards here.

95
00:05:29,367 --> 00:05:30,500
No one's inside.

96
00:05:30,633 --> 00:05:31,333
What do you mean no one?

97
00:05:31,467 --> 00:05:32,900
You can search the place.

98
00:05:33,033 --> 00:05:34,567
That's exactly what we'll do!

99
00:05:34,733 --> 00:05:35,833
Secure this!

100
00:05:35,967 --> 00:05:37,500
- Come with us!
- Yes, Sir.

101
00:05:37,633 --> 00:05:41,133
Come with us!

102
00:05:41,267 --> 00:05:42,867
- You need to go.
- What?

103
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,767
No time to explain,
just leave now.

104
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:46,533
No, we're leaving together,
us both.

105
00:05:46,667 --> 00:05:48,167
Listen, Peter!

106
00:05:48,300 --> 00:05:50,533
I need you to get out of here.

107
00:05:50,667 --> 00:05:54,167
Stop those cops and tell them
not to go inside.

108
00:05:54,300 --> 00:05:55,267
No, you're coming with me.

109
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:57,000
Just do what you're told!

110
00:05:57,133 --> 00:05:58,433
Go!

111
00:06:01,033 --> 00:06:02,833
[GATE CREAKS]

112
00:06:02,967 --> 00:06:04,467
Move!

113
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:08,600
[BRAZEN MUSIC CONTINUES]

114
00:06:12,333 --> 00:06:13,667
Joey.

115
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:16,467
Andrew...

116
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,733
what are you doing here?

117
00:06:18,867 --> 00:06:20,533
I followed you.

118
00:06:20,667 --> 00:06:21,700
And you, what are you doing
here?

119
00:06:21,833 --> 00:06:23,767
This looks like an official
operation, Joey.

120
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:25,233
You're not allowed here.

121
00:06:28,633 --> 00:06:31,700
Peter followed Jin Ho
to warn him.

122
00:06:31,833 --> 00:06:34,100
He might get trapped inside.

123
00:06:34,233 --> 00:06:36,800
I couldn't just leave him.

124
00:06:36,933 --> 00:06:37,933
There you go again.

125
00:06:38,067 --> 00:06:40,600
You're being reckless again.

126
00:06:40,767 --> 00:06:43,667
Joey, you're rushing
into decisions again.

127
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,167
So what?

128
00:06:45,867 --> 00:06:47,633
I'm not letting you go there.

129
00:06:48,833 --> 00:06:52,533
Andrew, you're not my parent
nor my boyfriend to stop me.

130
00:06:52,667 --> 00:06:56,667
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

131
00:07:10,767 --> 00:07:14,767
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

132
00:07:33,633 --> 00:07:37,700
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

133
00:07:38,767 --> 00:07:39,967
Get inside!

134
00:07:45,833 --> 00:07:48,000
[GUN COCKS]
Men, move!

135
00:07:51,133 --> 00:07:52,933
[GUN COCKS]

136
00:07:53,067 --> 00:07:56,400
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

137
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,467
[GUN COCKS]

138
00:08:09,367 --> 00:08:13,433
[FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING]

139
00:08:22,133 --> 00:08:23,333
Why is no one here?

140
00:08:23,467 --> 00:08:25,767
Where are they?

141
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:28,067
Even the evidence is gone.

142
00:08:33,967 --> 00:08:35,500
[RATTLES]

143
00:08:35,633 --> 00:08:37,367
Ambush! Cover!

144
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:43,033
[EXPLOSIONS]

145
00:08:43,167 --> 00:08:44,733
[GUN FIRING]

146
00:08:44,867 --> 00:08:46,067
Joey!

147
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:50,433
[GUN FIRING]

148
00:08:52,333 --> 00:08:56,333
[GUN FIRING]

149
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:04,233
This way, come!
This way! This way!

150
00:09:04,367 --> 00:09:08,400
[GUN FIRING IN DISTANCE]

151
00:09:08,533 --> 00:09:09,567
Joey, I told you,

152
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:11,733
you're not ready
for situations like this.

153
00:09:11,867 --> 00:09:13,967
Fine, you're right!

154
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:15,567
Let's go home then.

155
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,767
But what about Peter?
He's still inside!

156
00:09:19,033 --> 00:09:20,233
You have to leave now!

157
00:09:20,367 --> 00:09:21,233
What about you?

158
00:09:21,367 --> 00:09:22,733
If you don't leave,
I'll stay too.

159
00:09:22,867 --> 00:09:23,667
So when they arrive,

160
00:09:23,800 --> 00:09:25,100
I'll tell them
you didn't fight back.

161
00:09:25,233 --> 00:09:27,133
None of them will survive here.

162
00:09:27,300 --> 00:09:28,633
This is an ambush!

163
00:09:28,767 --> 00:09:30,000
What?

164
00:09:30,133 --> 00:09:34,300
[GUN FIRING]

165
00:09:34,700 --> 00:09:37,033
There's nowhere to run!

166
00:09:37,167 --> 00:09:39,400
You can't beat me
at my own game.

167
00:09:39,533 --> 00:09:40,700
What about you?
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

168
00:09:40,833 --> 00:09:42,733
Don't you want to go there?

169
00:09:42,867 --> 00:09:46,600
I'll give a big prize
to whoever kills the most.

170
00:09:46,733 --> 00:09:50,033
Go on, finish them all!

171
00:09:56,233 --> 00:09:58,000
Take this phone and just go!

172
00:09:58,133 --> 00:09:59,833
Now! Leave now!

173
00:09:59,967 --> 00:10:02,067
Go! Go!

174
00:10:02,233 --> 00:10:06,367
[GUN FIRING IN DISTANCE]

175
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:10,700
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

176
00:10:25,267 --> 00:10:29,467
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

177
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:33,400
[GUN FIRING IN DISTANCE]

178
00:10:36,233 --> 00:10:37,667
- Peter!
- Joey, come on!

179
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:38,933
Peter...

180
00:10:39,067 --> 00:10:40,433
Thank goodness you're okay.

181
00:10:41,067 --> 00:10:42,367
Jin Ho saved me.

182
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:44,567
But why isn't he with you?

183
00:10:44,700 --> 00:10:47,867
He said those who went inside
won't survive.

184
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,700
He said this is an ambush.

185
00:10:49,833 --> 00:10:54,567
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

186
00:10:54,900 --> 00:10:56,067
<i> The plan worked.</i>

187
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:59,700
<i>Miguel and the stupid DDE agents
all took the bait.</i>

188
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:01,433
Tell me everything.
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

189
00:11:01,567 --> 00:11:05,567
I'm watching them fall
one by one.

190
00:11:05,700 --> 00:11:09,967
I'm sure they regret storming
this warehouse.

191
00:11:10,133 --> 00:11:14,267
Don't let that "ghost" cop
get out alive.

192
00:11:14,400 --> 00:11:16,133
He made a fool of me.

193
00:11:16,267 --> 00:11:19,500
<i>Now, I want him riddled
with bullets</i>

194
00:11:19,633 --> 00:11:22,333
so his real burial could happen.

195
00:11:22,467 --> 00:11:26,000
That's exactly why I wanted
to do this.

196
00:11:26,133 --> 00:11:27,433
Good thing you agreed.

197
00:11:27,567 --> 00:11:28,533
<i> I must admit,</i>

198
00:11:28,667 --> 00:11:30,733
<i>I had apprehensions
about your plan.</i>

199
00:11:30,867 --> 00:11:32,333
<i> We expect to lose a lot.</i>

200
00:11:32,467 --> 00:11:34,433
<i> But I realized...</i>

201
00:11:34,567 --> 00:11:38,600
<i> we also gain much
once the enemies are eliminated.</i>

202
00:11:38,733 --> 00:11:40,133
<i>We need to move
to a bigger location</i>

203
00:11:40,267 --> 00:11:42,233
<i> for our operations.</i>

204
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:44,733
Anyway, congratulations to you

205
00:11:44,867 --> 00:11:46,867
<i> and your people.</i>

206
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,567
Don't delay it anymore.

207
00:11:48,700 --> 00:11:49,933
<i> Yes, Berdugo.</i>

208
00:11:50,067 --> 00:11:52,300
See you at the new place.

209
00:11:52,433 --> 00:11:56,400
[UNEASY MUSIC CONTINUES]

210
00:11:58,333 --> 00:12:00,667
You look happy.

211
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:02,933
What's that call about?
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

212
00:12:03,067 --> 00:12:05,100
I just had a big win today

213
00:12:05,233 --> 00:12:08,433
because a huge hindrance
will be gone.

214
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:11,867
What hindrance?
A business rival?

215
00:12:12,700 --> 00:12:14,800
A huge enemy.

216
00:12:14,967 --> 00:12:19,400
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

217
00:12:22,400 --> 00:12:24,200
We need to go to dad!

218
00:12:24,333 --> 00:12:26,733
What? You'll rush into
the middle of a gunfight?

219
00:12:26,867 --> 00:12:30,267
Joey, you can't help them
inside.

220
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:31,567
Your father might get distracted

221
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:33,633
and you could put him
in more danger.

222
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:36,567
So, what do we do?

223
00:12:36,700 --> 00:12:38,067
I'll call Chief.

224
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:39,533
I'll ask for back up.

225
00:12:41,900 --> 00:12:42,600
Joey, calm down.

226
00:12:42,733 --> 00:12:43,867
Jin Ho is inside.

227
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:47,100
He'll find a way
to save your father.

228
00:12:47,233 --> 00:12:49,033
Really? Will he do that?

229
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:52,000
You're not even sure
if he's still on our side.

230
00:12:52,133 --> 00:12:53,333
He will.

231
00:12:53,467 --> 00:12:55,767
He already let me escape
so nothing would happen to me.

232
00:12:55,900 --> 00:12:59,867
[UNEASY MUSIC CONTINUES]

233
00:13:10,133 --> 00:13:11,900
I didn't want it to go to waste.

234
00:13:12,033 --> 00:13:13,700
You knew they were coming?

235
00:13:14,500 --> 00:13:17,867
Yes, because you led them here.

236
00:13:20,433 --> 00:13:22,133
I didn't do anything.

237
00:13:22,300 --> 00:13:24,500
You don't realize it,

238
00:13:24,633 --> 00:13:26,800
but you're the one
who led them here.

239
00:13:29,867 --> 00:13:31,833
<i> Ma'am, someone's here.</i>

240
00:13:32,367 --> 00:13:33,467
<i> Delgado?</i>

241
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:35,967
<i> He's back from the dead.</i>

242
00:13:36,100 --> 00:13:37,333
<i> We'll follow him.</i>

243
00:13:37,467 --> 00:13:38,833
<i> No.</i>

244
00:13:40,967 --> 00:13:43,133
<i> I have a better idea.</i>

245
00:13:44,867 --> 00:13:47,300
So, Joey's father is alive?

246
00:13:47,833 --> 00:13:50,600
All flesh and bones.

247
00:13:52,300 --> 00:13:54,633
That means you followed me.

248
00:13:54,800 --> 00:13:56,667
You don't trust me?

249
00:13:56,800 --> 00:13:59,067
It hurts to be betrayed,
doesn't it?

250
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:01,433
That's exactly how I felt
when I realized

251
00:14:01,567 --> 00:14:03,767
your friend exposed me.

252
00:14:04,767 --> 00:14:07,567
- What are you talking about?
- Oh, come on, Jin Ho!

253
00:14:07,700 --> 00:14:10,500
You know it was the girl
in the hoodie.

254
00:14:10,633 --> 00:14:12,733
And you know I've been
looking for her

255
00:14:12,867 --> 00:14:13,767
so I can get back at her

256
00:14:13,900 --> 00:14:16,033
for all the problems
she caused me.

257
00:14:16,167 --> 00:14:18,633
But you kept her away from me!

258
00:14:18,767 --> 00:14:24,033
Because when I was with her,
and other friends,

259
00:14:24,167 --> 00:14:25,900
they showed me kindness.

260
00:14:26,033 --> 00:14:27,933
Kindness, yes.

261
00:14:28,933 --> 00:14:30,467
Kindness...

262
00:14:30,600 --> 00:14:32,867
you're a fool, Jin Ho.

263
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:35,200
She is just using you.

264
00:14:35,333 --> 00:14:37,700
She met with you to plant
a tracker

265
00:14:37,833 --> 00:14:39,100
and that lead them here.

266
00:14:39,233 --> 00:14:44,367
Do you think they care
if you die?

267
00:14:44,500 --> 00:14:46,033
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

268
00:14:46,167 --> 00:14:47,667
I don't think so.

269
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:49,833
So why would you care
about them?

270
00:14:49,967 --> 00:14:53,500
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

271
00:14:53,633 --> 00:14:54,900
That's done.

272
00:14:55,733 --> 00:14:57,833
Prove your loyalty!

273
00:15:00,033 --> 00:15:04,000
- [GUN FIRING]
- [INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

274
00:15:05,367 --> 00:15:08,600
[GUN FIRING]

275
00:15:08,733 --> 00:15:12,067
[INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

276
00:15:13,500 --> 00:15:17,167
[GUN FIRING]

277
00:15:17,300 --> 00:15:20,933
[INTENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

278
00:15:22,733 --> 00:15:24,133
[GUN FIRING]

279
00:15:24,667 --> 00:15:26,233
[GUN COCKS]

280
00:15:27,033 --> 00:15:31,033
[GUN FIRING]

281
00:15:37,967 --> 00:15:39,933
[BULLETS PLINKING]

282
00:15:40,067 --> 00:15:43,267
[GUN FIRING]

283
00:15:49,433 --> 00:15:50,467
Are you okay?

284
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:51,933
I'm fine, Sir!

285
00:15:52,067 --> 00:15:53,633
Let's finish this!

286
00:15:53,767 --> 00:15:56,400
[GUN FIRING IN DISTANCE]

287
00:15:58,433 --> 00:16:01,567
[GUN FIRING]

288
00:16:01,700 --> 00:16:05,067
[INTENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

289
00:16:17,867 --> 00:16:19,267
Stop!

290
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:20,933
Hands up!

291
00:16:21,067 --> 00:16:24,467
[FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING]

292
00:16:30,767 --> 00:16:32,333
Liza De Leon!

293
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:34,333
Jin Ho!

294
00:16:34,867 --> 00:16:36,367
You're under arrest!

295
00:16:36,500 --> 00:16:38,133
Put your guns down!

296
00:16:38,267 --> 00:16:42,433
[FOREBODING MUSIC CONTINUES]

297
00:16:52,967 --> 00:16:55,233
[FOREBODING MUSIC CONTINUES]

298
00:16:55,967 --> 00:16:57,400
Did you talk to them?

299
00:16:57,733 --> 00:16:58,900
The police are on their way,

300
00:16:59,033 --> 00:17:01,533
and the DDE agents have backup.

301
00:17:01,667 --> 00:17:03,000
Good thing there's
reinforcement.

302
00:17:03,133 --> 00:17:04,900
Joey, we need to leave.

303
00:17:05,033 --> 00:17:07,133
That's Chief Lansang's order.

304
00:17:07,267 --> 00:17:08,467
Andrew, I don't want to!

305
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:11,267
I won't leave while my father
is inside,

306
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:12,967
fighting for his life!

307
00:17:13,100 --> 00:17:17,467
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

308
00:17:18,467 --> 00:17:21,567
Do you really think
you can defeat us that easily?

309
00:17:21,700 --> 00:17:23,433
Nothing here is easy!

310
00:17:23,567 --> 00:17:25,467
I was imprisoned,

311
00:17:25,600 --> 00:17:27,033
I almost got killed,

312
00:17:27,800 --> 00:17:30,300
and torn away from my family!

313
00:17:30,433 --> 00:17:33,333
Poor Miguel Delgado.

314
00:17:33,833 --> 00:17:35,500
What do you want me to do?

315
00:17:36,433 --> 00:17:38,633
Cry over your tragic life?

316
00:17:38,767 --> 00:17:40,967
You're coming with us...

317
00:17:41,100 --> 00:17:43,967
and you'll reveal
the syndicate's secret,

318
00:17:44,100 --> 00:17:45,767
and who Berdugo really is!

319
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:50,067
So, what now,
are we just going to sit here?

320
00:17:51,133 --> 00:17:52,633
Wait, let me check if it's safe.

321
00:17:52,767 --> 00:17:54,133
Stay here.

322
00:17:54,267 --> 00:17:58,567
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

323
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,567
Come on, let's go!

324
00:18:11,300 --> 00:18:12,467
Hey!

325
00:18:13,867 --> 00:18:15,633
Put your guns down!
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

326
00:18:17,167 --> 00:18:18,433
I said put them down!

327
00:18:18,567 --> 00:18:21,300
Put them down!

328
00:18:21,467 --> 00:18:24,933
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

329
00:18:28,167 --> 00:18:29,233
Hey, let go of that!

330
00:18:29,367 --> 00:18:31,267
- [THUDDING]
- [BRAZEN MUSIC PLAYING]

331
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:33,367
Andrew, Peter!

332
00:18:33,500 --> 00:18:35,600
[GRUNTING]

333
00:18:35,733 --> 00:18:36,900
[THUDS]

334
00:18:39,867 --> 00:18:41,033
[THUDS]

335
00:18:42,533 --> 00:18:44,400
- [THUDDING]
- [GRUNTING]

336
00:18:45,567 --> 00:18:48,767
- [THUDDING]
- [GRUNTING]

337
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:50,933
[THUDS]

338
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:53,367
- [CLANKS]
- [THUDS]

339
00:18:53,500 --> 00:18:57,967
- [THUDDING]
- [GRUNTING]

340
00:18:58,133 --> 00:19:01,300
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

341
00:19:02,867 --> 00:19:06,433
- [THUDDING]
- [GRUNTING]

342
00:19:07,267 --> 00:19:11,200
- [THUDDING]
- [GRUNTING]

343
00:19:12,900 --> 00:19:14,067
[THUDS]

344
00:19:14,200 --> 00:19:15,167
[WHACKS]

345
00:19:15,300 --> 00:19:18,267
- [THUDDING]
- [GRUNTING]

346
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:19,733
[GROANS]

347
00:19:20,967 --> 00:19:22,867
[THUDDING]

348
00:19:25,967 --> 00:19:30,067
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

349
00:19:39,800 --> 00:19:41,800
Dad, where are you?

350
00:19:41,933 --> 00:19:45,900
[UNEASY MUSIC CONTINUES]

351
00:19:51,233 --> 00:19:53,633
You can't make me confess!

352
00:19:53,767 --> 00:19:55,100
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

353
00:19:55,233 --> 00:19:57,467
You'll get nothing from me!

354
00:20:02,100 --> 00:20:04,033
And besides...

355
00:20:04,633 --> 00:20:07,367
none of you
will leave here alive!

356
00:20:10,800 --> 00:20:11,733
Zoey!

357
00:20:11,867 --> 00:20:13,767
- [GUN FIRING]
- [TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

358
00:20:13,900 --> 00:20:15,067
[ZOEY GROANS]

359
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:18,633
[GUN FIRING]

360
00:20:19,900 --> 00:20:20,967
[GUN FIRING]

361
00:20:21,500 --> 00:20:24,767
[GUN FIRING]

362
00:20:26,100 --> 00:20:29,867
[GUN FIRING]

363
00:20:30,867 --> 00:20:32,533
Madam, let's go!

364
00:20:32,667 --> 00:20:34,233
Go ahead, I will cover you.

365
00:20:34,800 --> 00:20:39,200
[GUN FIRING]

366
00:20:39,333 --> 00:20:42,067
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

367
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:43,967
[ZOEY GROANS]

368
00:20:45,133 --> 00:20:46,633
Zoey!

369
00:20:47,100 --> 00:20:48,833
[ZOEY GROANS]

370
00:20:49,633 --> 00:20:53,667
[GUN FIRING]

371
00:20:55,933 --> 00:20:57,767
[GUN FIRING]

372
00:20:57,900 --> 00:20:58,767
Go after Liza!

373
00:20:58,900 --> 00:21:01,000
There! I'll cover for you!

374
00:21:01,133 --> 00:21:05,000
[GUN FIRING]

375
00:21:05,700 --> 00:21:07,967
[GUN FIRING]

376
00:21:09,033 --> 00:21:11,567
[GUN FIRING]

377
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:14,900
[ZOEY PANTING]
Zoey...

378
00:21:15,033 --> 00:21:17,967
Sir, it hurts,
I don't want to die yet.

379
00:21:18,667 --> 00:21:19,667
That won't happen.

380
00:21:19,800 --> 00:21:21,867
We still need you.

381
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:22,833
[ZOEY GRUNTS]

382
00:21:22,967 --> 00:21:24,000
Apply pressure on your wound.

383
00:21:24,133 --> 00:21:28,100
[ZOEY GROANING]

384
00:21:28,233 --> 00:21:33,167
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

385
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:37,667
[OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

386
00:21:37,800 --> 00:21:39,167
- Joey!
- Joey!

387
00:21:39,300 --> 00:21:40,767
Come on, Peter!

388
00:21:42,700 --> 00:21:46,467
[GUN FIRING]

389
00:21:46,600 --> 00:21:49,567
[OMINOUS MUSIC CONTINUES]

390
00:21:50,633 --> 00:21:51,900
[GUN FIRING]

391
00:21:52,633 --> 00:21:54,367
[GUN FIRING]

392
00:21:55,233 --> 00:21:59,167
[GUN FIRING]

393
00:21:59,733 --> 00:22:03,533
[GUN FIRING]

394
00:22:04,933 --> 00:22:06,867
Call Joey, quick!

395
00:22:12,700 --> 00:22:15,900
[PHONE RINGING]

396
00:22:17,433 --> 00:22:18,833
Sorry, Peter,
I'll talk to you later.

397
00:22:18,967 --> 00:22:21,267
I still need to see dad.

398
00:22:21,400 --> 00:22:23,200
[RINGING CONTIUES]

399
00:22:24,333 --> 00:22:26,267
Joey isn't answering.

400
00:22:28,533 --> 00:22:29,700
I hope she's okay.

401
00:22:29,833 --> 00:22:31,300
Let's go!

402
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:36,000
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

403
00:22:43,900 --> 00:22:46,667
[ZOEY WHIMPERING]

404
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:47,833
Where's the back up?

405
00:22:47,967 --> 00:22:49,900
We need the back up now!

406
00:22:50,067 --> 00:22:52,767
[ZOEY GROANING]

407
00:22:52,900 --> 00:22:55,033
[GUN FIRING]

408
00:22:55,833 --> 00:22:58,667
Zoey, you might bleed out here.

409
00:22:58,800 --> 00:23:00,467
We're leaving.

410
00:23:00,600 --> 00:23:02,200
Let's go.

411
00:23:02,333 --> 00:23:06,333
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

412
00:23:17,400 --> 00:23:20,200
[ZOEY GROANING]

413
00:23:20,333 --> 00:23:24,467
[INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

414
00:23:28,133 --> 00:23:30,100
They waited until
we were all inside

415
00:23:30,233 --> 00:23:31,600
before they opened fire.

416
00:23:31,733 --> 00:23:32,467
They prepared for this.

417
00:23:32,600 --> 00:23:33,633
Clean this mess up.

418
00:23:33,767 --> 00:23:35,433
We'll still bring down
the syndicate.

419
00:23:35,567 --> 00:23:37,100
But you know, I realized...

420
00:23:37,233 --> 00:23:39,067
I'm here to kill you.

421
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:40,233
Do it, Jin Ho!

422
00:23:40,367 --> 00:23:41,533
Didn't she betray you?

423
00:23:41,667 --> 00:23:42,933
Jin Ho, don't, please.

424
00:23:43,067 --> 00:23:45,667
You used me to get Liza.

425
00:23:45,800 --> 00:23:49,500
Have a safe trip to hell, Joey.

426
00:23:49,633 --> 00:23:50,800
Andrew, I'm begging you.

427
00:23:50,933 --> 00:23:53,200
Don't report this to<i> Tirada</i> yet.

428
00:23:53,333 --> 00:23:55,500
Major, I'm not here to cover.

429
00:23:55,667 --> 00:23:56,733
I came for Joey.

430
00:23:56,867 --> 00:23:57,833
Joey?

431
00:23:57,967 --> 00:23:59,633
Jin Ho took her, Major.

432
00:23:59,767 --> 00:24:00,967
What?
